  "type": "Document",
  "raw": "Plain *strong* and _emphasis_ and `code` text.\n\nUnconstrained **st**rong, __em__phasis and ``co``de.\n\nNested *strong with _emphasis_ inside*.\n\nLiteral monospace `+*not strong*+` stays code.\n\nEscaped \\*not strong* and \\_not emphasis_.\n\n日本語の**強調**と``コード``と__斜体__。\n\nConstrained marks inside words like snake_case_name and a*b*c are ignored.\n\nLinks: https://example.com, https://example.com/path[with label], link:relative/path.html[relative link], mailto:someone@example.com[mail] and <https://example.org>.\n\nMacros stay in text: image:icon_file.png[Alt] footnote:[A _footnote_.] xref:other.adoc#id[Cross *ref*] <<anchor_id>> {attribute_name}.\n\nHard line break +\ncontinues here.\n\n[.role]*Styled strong* text.\n",
